This template formats daily editions of ''The Okami Times'' as a newspaper-style page with masthead, section headers, and broadsheet styling.

==Usage==
<pre>
{{The Okami Times edition
| date = 10 June 2026
| era = Jutsu 15
| edition_note = Morning Edition
| headlines = 
'''Headline 1'''
Story text...

| entertainment = 
'''Headline'''
Story text...

| international = 
'''Headline'''
Story text...

| sports = 
'''Headline'''
Story text...

| worldcup = 
'''Headline'''
Story text... (2026 AFA World Cup — 14 June to 15 July; omit outside tournament)

| editorial = 
'''Editorial Title'''
Editorial text...

'''Columnist Name — Column Title'''
Column text...

| okami = 
;Okami / Matsushika-ku
'''Headline''' — Story text.

;Okami / Chiyoda-ku
'''Headline''' — Story text.

| regional = 
;Noto / Ohara
'''Headline''' — Story text.

;Ehime / Onan
'''Headline''' — Story text.
}}
</pre>

==Parameters==
* '''date''' (required): Publication date, e.g. "10 June 2026"
* '''era''' (required): Jutsu era date, e.g. "Jutsu 15"
* '''edition_note''' (optional): Edition type, defaults to "Morning Edition"
* '''headlines''' (required): Front-page stories
* '''entertainment''' (optional): Entertainment and culture
* '''international''' (optional): International news
* '''sports''' (optional): Sports stories
* '''worldcup''' (conditional): 2026 AFA World Cup coverage — only renders if parameter is provided; use during tournament (14 June – 15 July 2026)
* '''editorial''' (required): Editorials, columns, and opinion pieces — left-leaning editorial voice
* '''okami''' (required): Okami Metropolis and Okami Region local news — 3-5 items with location subheaders
* '''regional''' (optional): Regional news briefs — use location subheaders (;Prefecture / City)

==Regional Formatting==
Regional items use semicolon subheaders for location instead of inline tags:
<pre>
;Prefecture / City
'''Headline''' — Story text.
</pre>
NOT: '''Headline''' — Story text. [Prefecture/City]

